{"id":"forecast-10","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-10/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":420.84,"segments":[{"start":0.75,"end":5.27,"text":"IELTS Listening, version 5-2-2-0-6.","words":[["IELTS",0.75,1.71],["Listening,",1.71,2.13],["version",2.79,3.17],["5",3.17,3.63],["-2",3.63,4.09],["-2",4.09,4.37],["-0",4.37,4.89],["-6.",4.89,5.27]]},{"start":6.79,"end":12.39,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings and you will have to answer questions on what","words":[["You",6.79,7.43],["will",7.43,7.63],["hear",7.63,7.87],["a",7.87,8.03],["number",8.03,8.35],["of",8.35,8.59],["different",8.59,8.89],["recordings",8.89,9.47],["and",9.47,10.35],["you",10.35,10.51],["will",10.51,10.61],["have",10.61,10.79],["to",10.79,10.93],["answer",10.93,11.25],["questions",11.25,11.79],["on",11.79,12.21],["what",12.21,12.39]]},{"start":12.39,"end":18.27,"text":"you hear. There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions and you will","words":[["you",12.39,12.59],["hear.",12.59,12.97],["There",13.87,14.19],["will",14.19,14.33],["be",14.33,14.49],["time",14.49,14.85],["for",14.85,15.11],["you",15.11,15.21],["to",15.21,15.31],["read",15.31,15.61],["the",15.61,15.85],["instructions",15.85,16.39],["and",16.39,16.69],["questions",16.69,17.07],["and",17.07,17.97],["you",17.97,18.15],["will",18.15,18.27]]},{"start":18.27,"end":24.29,"text":"have a chance to check your work. All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["have",18.27,18.41],["a",18.41,18.57],["chance",18.57,18.81],["to",18.81,19.05],["check",19.05,19.37],["your",19.37,19.57],["work.",19.57,19.97],["All",20.89,21.35],["the",21.35,21.47],["recordings",21.47,21.87],["will",21.87,22.49],["be",22.49,22.63],["played",22.63,23.03],["once",23.03,23.61],["only.",23.61,24.29]]},{"start":24.29,"end":33.53,"text":"The test is in four parts. Write all your answers in the listening question booklet. At the","words":[["The",24.29,24.85],["test",24.85,26.19],["is",26.19,26.95],["in",26.95,27.09],["four",27.09,27.47],["parts.",27.47,28.05],["Write",28.83,29.09],["all",29.09,29.41],["your",29.41,29.57],["answers",29.57,29.99],["in",29.99,30.67],["the",30.67,30.79],["listening",30.79,31.15],["question",31.15,31.61],["booklet.",31.61,32.09],["At",32.93,33.41],["the",33.41,33.53]]},{"start":33.53,"end":39.05,"text":"end of the test you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet.","words":[["end",33.53,33.75],["of",33.75,33.87],["the",33.87,33.97],["test",33.97,34.33],["you",34.33,34.97],["will",34.97,35.11],["be",35.11,35.25],["given",35.25,35.55],["ten",35.55,35.93],["minutes",35.93,36.37],["to",36.37,36.69],["transfer",36.69,37.27],["your",37.27,37.51],["answers",37.51,37.91],["to",37.91,38.23],["an",38.23,38.41],["answer",38.41,38.71],["sheet.",38.71,39.05]]},{"start":41.06,"end":45.38,"text":"Now turn to part one on page two of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",41.06,41.48],["turn",41.48,41.74],["to",41.74,41.98],["part",41.98,42.2],["one",42.2,42.68],["on",42.68,43.4],["page",43.4,43.78],["two",43.78,44.26],["of",44.26,44.46],["your",44.46,44.58],["question",44.58,44.9],["booklet.",44.9,45.38]]},{"start":50.4,"end":57.36,"text":"Part one. You will hear a woman telephoning an international school in Dubai for information.","words":[["Part",50.4,50.78],["one.",50.78,51.22],["You",52.12,52.78],["will",52.78,52.96],["hear",52.96,53.16],["a",53.16,53.3],["woman",53.3,53.5],["telephoning",53.5,54.2],["an",54.2,54.42],["international",54.42,54.88],["school",54.88,55.46],["in",55.46,55.78],["Dubai",55.78,56.08],["for",56.08,56.76],["information.",56.76,57.36]]},{"start":58.66,"end":100.53,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions one to seven. Now listen carefully and answer","words":[["First,",58.66,59.22],["you",59.72,59.9],["have",59.9,60.06],["some",60.06,60.26],["time",60.26,60.62],["to",60.62,60.84],["look",60.84,60.92],["at",60.92,61.08],["questions",61.08,61.5],["one",61.5,62.22],["to",62.22,62.68],["seven.",62.68,63.08],["Now",98.55,98.91],["listen",98.91,99.25],["carefully",99.25,99.71],["and",99.71,100.23],["answer",100.23,100.53]]},{"start":100.53,"end":102.59,"text":"questions one to seven.","words":[["questions",100.53,101.03],["one",101.03,101.71],["to",101.71,102.15],["seven.",102.15,102.59]]},{"start":106.04,"end":108.34,"text":"The international school, how can I help you?","words":[["The",106.04,106.38],["international",106.38,106.88],["school,",106.88,107.38],["how",107.58,107.68],["can",107.68,107.84],["I",107.84,107.94],["help",107.94,108.14],["you?",108.14,108.34]]},{"start":108.84,"end":113.64,"text":"Good morning. I was wondering if you could give me some information. I've just moved","words":[["Good",108.84,109.14],["morning.",109.14,109.4],["I",109.94,110.12],["was",110.12,110.3],["wondering",110.3,110.64],["if",110.64,110.92],["you",110.92,111.06],["could",111.06,111.2],["give",111.2,111.38],["me",111.38,111.56],["some",111.56,111.7],["information.",111.7,112.18],["I've",112.84,113.12],["just",113.12,113.3],["moved",113.3,113.64]]},{"start":113.64,"end":119.24,"text":"to Dubai and I have a boy of eight. I'm looking for a school for him. Could you give me some","words":[["to",113.64,113.86],["Dubai",113.86,114.08],["and",114.08,114.64],["I",114.64,114.88],["have",114.88,115.06],["a",115.06,115.16],["boy",115.16,115.3],["of",115.3,115.46],["eight.",115.46,115.76],["I'm",116.32,116.6],["looking",116.6,116.78],["for",116.78,117.0],["a",117.0,117.12],["school",117.12,117.4],["for",117.4,117.68],["him.",117.68,117.92],["Could",118.36,118.62],["you",118.62,118.78],["give",118.78,118.94],["me",118.94,119.08],["some",119.08,119.24]]},{"start":119.24,"end":120.54,"text":"details about your school?","words":[["details",119.24,119.58],["about",119.58,120.0],["your",120.0,120.28],["school?",120.28,120.54]]},{"start":120.54,"end":126.6,"text":"Yes, of course. The lower school takes children aged 4 to 7, and the middle school is for","words":[["Yes,",120.54,121.3],["of",121.48,121.54],["course.",121.54,121.82],["The",122.34,122.46],["lower",122.46,122.68],["school",122.68,122.96],["takes",122.96,123.28],["children",123.28,123.72],["aged",123.72,124.04],["4",124.04,124.34],["to",124.34,124.46],["7,",124.46,124.8],["and",124.84,125.32],["the",125.32,125.46],["middle",125.46,125.66],["school",125.66,125.98],["is",125.98,126.44],["for",126.44,126.6]]},{"start":126.6,"end":132.34,"text":"those aged 7 to 13. Children then go on to one of the senior schools in the area until","words":[["those",126.6,126.78],["aged",126.78,127.18],["7",127.18,127.58],["to",127.58,127.76],["13.",127.76,128.16],["Children",128.78,129.2],["then",129.2,129.52],["go",129.52,129.76],["on",129.76,129.94],["to",129.94,130.1],["one",130.1,130.24],["of",130.24,130.36],["the",130.36,130.5],["senior",130.5,130.8],["schools",130.8,131.26],["in",131.26,131.48],["the",131.48,131.58],["area",131.58,131.88],["until",131.88,132.34]]},{"start":132.34,"end":133.04,"text":"they're 18.","words":[["they're",132.34,132.66],["18.",132.66,133.04]]},{"start":133.76,"end":136.9,"text":"My neighbour told me you're near a golf course. Is that right?","words":[["My",133.76,134.14],["neighbour",134.14,134.48],["told",134.48,134.8],["me",134.8,134.98],["you're",134.98,135.2],["near",135.2,135.32],["a",135.32,135.48],["golf",135.48,135.74],["course.",135.74,136.24],["Is",136.38,136.5],["that",136.5,136.66],["right?",136.66,136.9]]},{"start":137.48,"end":140.02,"text":"Yes, that's right. There's one just across from us.","words":[["Yes,",137.48,137.78],["that's",137.86,138.14],["right.",138.14,138.32],["There's",138.56,138.78],["one",138.78,138.94],["just",138.94,139.18],["across",139.18,139.48],["from",139.48,139.82],["us.",139.82,140.02]]},{"start":140.46,"end":142.64,"text":"Right. Could you give me the address?","words":[["Right.",140.46,140.88],["Could",141.44,141.68],["you",141.68,141.9],["give",141.9,142.06],["me",142.06,142.2],["the",142.2,142.32],["address?",142.32,142.64]]},{"start":142.64,"end":142.86,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",142.64,142.86]]},{"start":143.08,"end":151.84,"text":"Of course. We're in Meadows Drive. That's M-E-A-D-O-W-S Drive. You can't miss us.","words":[["Of",143.08,143.26],["course.",143.26,143.62],["We're",144.06,144.36],["in",144.36,144.52],["Meadows",144.52,145.06],["Drive.",145.06,145.52],["That's",146.14,146.38],["M",146.38,146.82],["-E",146.82,147.16],["-A",147.16,147.52],["-D",147.52,148.14],["-O",148.14,148.76],["-W",148.76,149.16],["-S",149.16,149.8],["Drive.",149.8,150.52],["You",150.86,151.16],["can't",151.16,151.48],["miss",151.48,151.6],["us.",151.6,151.84]]},{"start":152.3,"end":156.26,"text":"Okay. Got that. Can I ask you a few more questions?","words":[["Okay.",152.3,152.8],["Got",153.18,153.4],["that.",153.4,153.6],["Can",154.36,154.88],["I",154.88,155.04],["ask",155.04,155.28],["you",155.28,155.44],["a",155.44,155.6],["few",155.6,155.72],["more",155.72,155.88],["questions?",155.88,156.26]]},{"start":156.82,"end":157.6,"text":"Go right ahead.","words":[["Go",156.82,157.1],["right",157.1,157.3],["ahead.",157.3,157.6]]},{"start":158.3,"end":163.82,"text":"Does the school have a uniform at all? My son didn't have to wear one at his last school.","words":[["Does",158.3,158.78],["the",158.78,159.0],["school",159.0,159.22],["have",159.22,159.48],["a",159.48,159.62],["uniform",159.62,160.24],["at",160.24,160.54],["all?",160.54,160.82],["My",161.36,161.54],["son",161.54,161.82],["didn't",161.82,162.1],["have",162.1,162.28],["to",162.28,162.46],["wear",162.46,162.68],["one",162.68,162.9],["at",162.9,163.06],["his",163.06,163.2],["last",163.2,163.46],["school.",163.46,163.82]]},{"start":164.16,"end":170.78,"text":"Yes, and it's actually quite smart. We've just changed the colour from a dark green shirt to a blue one.","words":[["Yes,",164.16,164.7],["and",164.88,165.12],["it's",165.12,165.34],["actually",165.34,165.68],["quite",165.68,165.94],["smart.",165.94,166.36],["We've",166.8,167.06],["just",167.06,167.3],["changed",167.3,167.68],["the",167.68,167.86],["colour",167.86,168.12],["from",168.12,168.34],["a",168.34,168.56],["dark",168.56,168.86],["green",168.86,169.2],["shirt",169.2,169.7],["to",169.7,170.12],["a",170.12,170.28],["blue",170.28,170.48],["one.",170.48,170.78]]},{"start":170.78,"end":173.2,"text":"That's with black trousers or shorts.","words":[["That's",170.78,171.52],["with",171.52,171.66],["black",171.66,171.98],["trousers",171.98,172.54],["or",172.54,172.9],["shorts.",172.9,173.2]]},{"start":173.82,"end":175.86,"text":"What's the school timetable like?","words":[["What's",173.82,174.46],["the",174.46,174.62],["school",174.62,174.86],["timetable",174.86,175.54],["like?",175.54,175.86]]},{"start":176.42,"end":182.58,"text":"Well, lessons begin at 7.20 Sunday to Thursday, although we do open at 7 o'clock.","words":[["Well,",176.42,176.66],["lessons",177.06,177.18],["begin",177.18,177.58],["at",177.58,177.76],["7",177.76,178.14],[".20",178.14,178.7],["Sunday",178.7,179.16],["to",179.16,179.5],["Thursday,",179.5,179.92],["although",180.48,180.8],["we",180.8,181.14],["do",181.14,181.32],["open",181.32,181.66],["at",181.66,181.82],["7",181.82,182.12],["o",182.12,182.24],["'clock.",182.24,182.58]]},{"start":183.24,"end":187.56,"text":"Lessons finish at 12.40 and the school closes at 2.30.","words":[["Lessons",183.24,183.72],["finish",183.72,184.02],["at",184.02,184.3],["12",184.3,184.56],[".40",184.56,185.04],["and",185.04,185.7],["the",185.7,185.92],["school",185.92,186.18],["closes",186.18,186.68],["at",186.68,186.92],["2",186.92,187.2],[".30.",187.2,187.56]]},{"start":188.16,"end":192.1,"text":"That's interesting because I leave here very early to get to work.","words":[["That's",188.16,188.72],["interesting",188.72,189.22],["because",189.22,189.68],["I",189.68,190.1],["leave",190.1,190.38],["here",190.38,190.66],["very",190.66,190.96],["early",190.96,191.34],["to",191.34,191.54],["get",191.54,191.68],["to",191.68,191.88],["work.",191.88,192.1]]},{"start":192.88,"end":196.48,"text":"Do you provide breakfast or does my son need to have this at home?","words":[["Do",192.88,193.16],["you",193.16,193.38],["provide",193.38,193.7],["breakfast",193.7,194.2],["or",194.2,194.72],["does",194.72,194.92],["my",194.92,195.08],["son",195.08,195.34],["need",195.34,195.56],["to",195.56,195.7],["have",195.7,195.9],["this",195.9,196.08],["at",196.08,196.22],["home?",196.22,196.48]]},{"start":196.48,"end":202.42,"text":"No, we have an early start program and we provide that for all the children who arrive early.","words":[["No,",196.48,197.32],["we",197.52,197.66],["have",197.66,197.86],["an",197.86,197.98],["early",197.98,198.18],["start",198.18,198.54],["program",198.54,199.12],["and",199.12,199.64],["we",199.64,199.84],["provide",199.84,200.28],["that",200.28,200.62],["for",200.62,200.88],["all",200.88,201.06],["the",201.06,201.2],["children",201.2,201.52],["who",201.52,201.76],["arrive",201.76,202.0],["early.",202.0,202.42]]},{"start":202.84,"end":205.24,"text":"Excellent. And after school?","words":[["Excellent.",202.84,203.26],["And",204.0,204.48],["after",204.48,204.88],["school?",204.88,205.24]]},{"start":205.94,"end":210.12,"text":"We have a range of activities on what we call our late stay program.","words":[["We",205.94,206.14],["have",206.14,206.3],["a",206.3,206.4],["range",206.4,206.7],["of",206.7,206.88],["activities",206.88,207.38],["on",207.38,207.72],["what",207.72,207.94],["we",207.94,208.18],["call",208.18,208.5],["our",208.5,208.72],["late",208.72,209.18],["stay",209.18,209.6],["program.",209.6,210.12]]},{"start":210.9,"end":215.58,"text":"There's some play time and help with homework, but we offer sport activities as well.","words":[["There's",210.9,211.22],["some",211.22,211.48],["play",211.48,211.72],["time",211.72,212.0],["and",212.0,212.22],["help",212.22,212.44],["with",212.44,212.64],["homework,",212.64,213.02],["but",213.34,213.58],["we",213.58,213.8],["offer",213.8,214.0],["sport",214.0,214.42],["activities",214.42,215.04],["as",215.04,215.32],["well.",215.32,215.58]]},{"start":216.22,"end":220.44,"text":"For example, last term we had basketball after school and now it's swimming.","words":[["For",216.22,216.38],["example,",216.38,216.76],["last",216.9,217.16],["term",217.16,217.46],["we",217.46,217.82],["had",217.82,218.0],["basketball",218.0,218.5],["after",218.5,219.1],["school",219.1,219.5],["and",219.5,219.74],["now",219.74,220.0],["it's",220.0,220.24],["swimming.",220.24,220.44]]},{"start":220.8,"end":224.36,"text":"Good. And what sort of music lessons are there?","words":[["Good.",220.8,221.1],["And",222.04,222.62],["what",222.62,222.82],["sort",222.82,223.02],["of",223.02,223.12],["music",223.12,223.42],["lessons",223.42,223.88],["are",223.88,224.16],["there?",224.16,224.36]]},{"start":224.36,"end":230.46,"text":"We have an orchestra and a rock band for the older children and a junior band for the younger ones.","words":[["We",224.36,225.18],["have",225.18,225.38],["an",225.38,225.48],["orchestra",225.48,225.86],["and",225.86,226.34],["a",226.34,226.5],["rock",226.5,226.72],["band",226.72,227.12],["for",227.12,227.36],["the",227.36,227.48],["older",227.48,227.72],["children",227.72,228.1],["and",228.1,228.68],["a",228.68,228.82],["junior",228.82,229.06],["band",229.06,229.46],["for",229.46,229.76],["the",229.76,229.86],["younger",229.86,230.1],["ones.",230.1,230.46]]},{"start":230.92,"end":234.28,"text":"My son plays the piano. Could he have lessons at the school?","words":[["My",230.92,231.16],["son",231.16,231.52],["plays",231.52,231.8],["the",231.8,232.0],["piano.",232.0,232.3],["Could",232.92,233.06],["he",233.06,233.24],["have",233.24,233.44],["lessons",233.44,233.76],["at",233.76,233.96],["the",233.96,234.06],["school?",234.06,234.28]]},{"start":234.82,"end":242.22,"text":"Yes, we have lessons on Tuesdays after school. We also have flute on Thursdays and clarinet on Mondays.","words":[["Yes,",234.82,235.08],["we",235.28,235.4],["have",235.4,235.62],["lessons",235.62,235.96],["on",235.96,236.16],["Tuesdays",236.16,236.9],["after",236.9,237.22],["school.",237.22,237.58],["We",238.04,238.28],["also",238.28,238.58],["have",238.58,238.86],["flute",238.86,239.2],["on",239.2,239.68],["Thursdays",239.68,240.58],["and",240.58,240.78],["clarinet",240.78,241.28],["on",241.28,241.76],["Mondays.",241.76,242.22]]},{"start":242.58,"end":249.3,"text":"That's great. What about languages? My son would like to do Spanish because his grandparents are from Mexico.","words":[["That's",242.58,242.92],["great.",242.92,243.22],["What",244.18,244.44],["about",244.44,244.74],["languages?",244.74,245.36],["My",246.0,246.22],["son",246.22,246.46],["would",246.46,246.6],["like",246.6,246.76],["to",246.76,246.92],["do",246.92,247.04],["Spanish",247.04,247.4],["because",247.4,247.8],["his",247.8,248.02],["grandparents",248.02,248.5],["are",248.5,248.76],["from",248.76,248.86],["Mexico.",248.86,249.3]]},{"start":249.3,"end":256.16,"text":"No problem. He's eight, isn't he? Well, he can do that now as classes start from when","words":[["No",249.3,250.16],["problem.",250.16,250.56],["He's",250.98,251.26],["eight,",251.26,251.54],["isn't",251.8,251.98],["he?",251.98,252.18],["Well,",252.8,253.22],["he",253.32,253.52],["can",253.52,253.74],["do",253.74,253.96],["that",253.96,254.18],["now",254.18,254.6],["as",254.6,254.84],["classes",254.84,255.26],["start",255.26,255.68],["from",255.68,255.98],["when",255.98,256.16]]},{"start":256.16,"end":260.68,"text":"the children are seven. When he's ten, we offer French or German as well.","words":[["the",256.16,256.3],["children",256.3,256.58],["are",256.58,256.8],["seven.",256.8,257.14],["When",257.74,258.02],["he's",258.02,258.3],["ten,",258.3,258.46],["we",258.62,258.74],["offer",258.74,258.96],["French",258.96,259.4],["or",259.4,259.66],["German",259.66,260.04],["as",260.04,260.4],["well.",260.4,260.68]]},{"start":264.07,"end":269.13,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions eight","words":[["Before",264.07,264.45],["you",264.45,264.71],["hear",264.71,264.89],["the",264.89,265.05],["rest",265.05,265.31],["of",265.31,265.45],["the",265.45,265.55],["conversation,",265.55,266.17],["you",266.73,266.93],["have",266.93,267.07],["some",267.07,267.25],["time",267.25,267.57],["to",267.57,267.79],["look",267.79,267.89],["at",267.89,268.05],["questions",268.05,268.47],["eight",268.47,269.13]]},{"start":269.13,"end":288.99,"text":"to ten. Now listen and answer questions eight to ten.","words":[["to",269.13,269.59],["ten.",269.59,269.93],["Now",285.25,285.65],["listen",285.65,285.99],["and",285.99,286.57],["answer",286.57,286.87],["questions",286.87,287.43],["eight",287.43,288.13],["to",288.13,288.57],["ten.",288.57,288.99]]},{"start":292.41,"end":297.21,"text":"Now, what about enrolment? Could I come along sometime and see the headteacher?","words":[["Now,",292.41,292.79],["what",292.93,293.23],["about",293.23,293.61],["enrolment?",293.61,294.47],["Could",294.81,294.95],["I",294.95,295.11],["come",295.11,295.29],["along",295.29,295.45],["sometime",295.45,295.99],["and",295.99,296.27],["see",296.27,296.47],["the",296.47,296.63],["headteacher?",296.63,297.21]]},{"start":297.21,"end":303.25,"text":"Yes indeed. Her name's Elizabeth Rose. She's usually free to speak to parents most days.","words":[["Yes",297.21,297.81],["indeed.",297.81,298.19],["Her",298.57,298.73],["name's",298.73,299.13],["Elizabeth",299.13,299.59],["Rose.",299.59,300.03],["She's",300.63,300.99],["usually",300.99,301.39],["free",301.39,301.61],["to",301.61,301.79],["speak",301.79,302.05],["to",302.05,302.25],["parents",302.25,302.57],["most",302.57,302.85],["days.",302.85,303.25]]},{"start":303.89,"end":311.99,"text":"Well, I could come in on Wednesday next week. I usually have a free day on a Tuesday, but that's been changed for next week.","words":[["Well,",303.89,304.21],["I",304.39,304.53],["could",304.53,304.85],["come",304.85,305.23],["in",305.23,305.41],["on",305.41,305.71],["Wednesday",305.71,306.37],["next",306.37,306.75],["week.",306.75,307.11],["I",307.67,307.85],["usually",307.85,308.23],["have",308.23,308.53],["a",308.53,308.65],["free",308.65,308.77],["day",308.77,309.03],["on",309.03,309.29],["a",309.29,309.39],["Tuesday,",309.39,309.75],["but",310.29,310.51],["that's",310.51,310.81],["been",310.81,310.95],["changed",310.95,311.33],["for",311.33,311.51],["next",311.51,311.69],["week.",311.69,311.99]]},{"start":312.37,"end":315.35,"text":"Okay. Would around 9.30 suit you?","words":[["Okay.",312.37,312.83],["Would",313.45,313.73],["around",313.73,314.07],["9",314.07,314.47],[".30",314.47,314.85],["suit",314.85,315.23],["you?",315.23,315.35]]},{"start":315.75,"end":321.11,"text":"Could we make it a bit later, say 10.15? I have a dentist appointment at 9.40.","words":[["Could",315.75,315.99],["we",315.99,316.15],["make",316.15,316.35],["it",316.35,316.47],["a",316.47,316.59],["bit",316.59,316.75],["later,",316.75,317.25],["say",317.47,317.69],["10",317.69,318.23],[".15?",318.23,318.51],["I",319.03,319.45],["have",319.45,319.61],["a",319.61,319.71],["dentist",319.71,319.95],["appointment",319.95,320.31],["at",320.31,320.59],["9",320.59,320.75],[".40.",320.75,321.11]]},{"start":321.99,"end":327.77,"text":"Great. Now, the head will give you a guided tour, of course, but is there anything special","words":[["Great.",321.99,322.47],["Now,",323.33,323.61],["the",323.71,323.83],["head",323.83,324.15],["will",324.15,324.31],["give",324.31,324.47],["you",324.47,324.61],["a",324.61,324.73],["guided",324.73,325.05],["tour,",325.05,325.53],["of",325.67,325.75],["course,",325.75,326.03],["but",326.41,326.63],["is",326.63,326.85],["there",326.85,326.95],["anything",326.95,327.17],["special",327.17,327.77]]},{"start":327.77,"end":332.79,"text":"you're interested in? For example, some parents are interested in speaking to the sports","words":[["you're",327.77,328.13],["interested",328.13,328.45],["in?",328.45,328.77],["For",